<h3><u>Mujo Maula hussain mujo aaka hussain</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Mujo Maula hussain mujo aaka hussain</u></strong></p>

<p>Mujo Mulula hussain mujo aaka hussain</p>

<p>Mera ishk bhi tu meri jaan bhi tu X 2</p>

<p>Mera din bhi tu imman bhi tu</p>

<p>Mera aan bhi tu meri sham bhi tu</p>

<p>Mera pir bhi tu sultan bhi tu sab waliyanja agvan bhi</p>

<p>Ay har momein X2</p>

<p>1. Ay har momein je dilje sada</p>

<p>Mujo mula hussain mujo aaka hussain.</p>

<p>Gulzar banaya X2 Ay dine khuda</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain.</p>

<p>2. Tu pyasa teree pyaas bari, hai din ko tujsi aas bari,</p>

<p>Tere naam se zinda naame khuda tere dam se hai islaam bacha</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain</p>

<p>3. Tu ibne baaye bismillah, tu lase kaha illallah,</p>

<p>Ai ibne ali, ai abde khuda, Kurane khudanaize pe para</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain</p>

<p>4. Sardare jinaa sardaare irm, ye saara rab ye saara jag,</p>

<p>Sab tere liye hai rab ki kasam, hai noore muhammed noore tera,</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain</p>

<p>5. Makhdum mere mere sayad, hoi khatm sitam ki tujh par had,</p>

<p>Parsabr tera allah hu samad, allah ne dedi apni raza,</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain</p>

<p>6. Sahbaz jo hai sehwan waale, nalan ki tere rakhwale,</p>

<p>Maidan me hai dere dale, hai laal kalandar ki bhi sadaa</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain</p>

<p>7. Ham sab hai matam daar tere, zindaa hai teri majlis ke liye,</p>

<p>Ai maula tere gham ke sadke, jo maanga khuda ne ham ko diya,</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain</p>

<p>8. Majlis me teri ghazi ka alam, karta hai tere gham mein matam,</p>

<p>Awaz ye aati hai hardam, zinda hai dilo mein dard tera,</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain</p>

<p>9. Gulzar banaya, gulzar banaya,</p>

<p>Ei dine khuda</p>

<p>Mujo maula hussain</p>
</p>